	"Description": "This turns sheep's into a pink sheep based off my youtube (@SheepyBo1) art channel mascot.\n<br />This is my first mod, so hopefully everything works as needed. Let me know if there's any issues.\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />FUTURE\n<br />Currently there's only one version of the sheep's but i intend to add a horned sheep, blushing sheep, and horned blushing sheep, and eventually add the horned and regular as variants so you don't have to choose. Maybe if enough people want it all have all as variants.\n<br />\n<br />IMPORTANT\n<br />Please let me know of any bugs, or issues. If you can, ways to solve it would be appreciated as I'm not experienced in this.\n<br />Please feel free to give suggestions for ideas or changes.\n<br />Until a variation pack is made, ONLY CHOOSE ONE MAIN.\n<br />Have fun!",
